# Regression: a style-value interpolation (which may span lines) inside a style block inside
# a string interpolation kept the style and interpolation frames open past the line end. The
# line terminator ends the outer string, so all four frames above code mode end there and the
# `}` on the next line is a code-mode `RBrace`, not an `InterpEnd`.
LetKw "let"
Ident "a"
Eq "="
StringStart "\""
InterpStart "{"
StyleKw "style"
LBrace "{"
Ident "x"
Colon ":"
InterpStart "{"
Ident "y"
Newline "\n"
RBrace "}"
Newline "\n"
